# Storyboard shot 3: the WROOM-3 part file in the Component 3D tab, with its markings.
# Project: examples/esp32-s31-wroom-3/esp32-s31-wroom-3.sparksmith (copy it first; the take never saves).
# Window points for a 1500 x 1235 pt window.
wait 0.5
key 1 cmd                        # Component workspace (start page)
wait 1.2
click 592 374 0.5                # open ESP32-S31-WROOM-3 (draft)
wait 1.2
click 477 56 0.5                 # 3D tab
wait 5                           # part file evaluates and the decals draw
key escape                       # drop the placement triad's focus
wait 0.4
mark in
caption "A parametric Solidcraft part" 3
move 560 980 0.8
drag 560 980 630 968 4.0 right   # slow orbit, started on empty canvas (a drag on the model or triad edits its placement)
wait 0.3
caption "Markings: laser etch and a QR code" 3.4
move 735 820 0.5
scroll 0 4 24 2.0                # dolly in on the etched can
zoom 1.45 735 800 4.0
wait 0.3
drag 600 990 550 998 3.2 right  # glide back, again from empty canvas
wait 0.8
mark out
